  "details": "Allow users to define a framerate at which the safety shield, avatar hider, avatar blocking, etc. features can enable or disable. \n\nFor example: If I were to sit below 15 FPS for longer than 5 or 10 seconds, automatically reduce settings to help recover framerate.\n\nThis feature would be useful to improve the user experience overall. Reduces chances of crashing, improves framerates, and doesn't require the user to use their laggy UI to try to manually enable these settings.",
